{"ref":"BDB, בְּעִיר","hw":"בְּעִיר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעִיר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:4\" href=\"/Exodus.22.4\">Ex 22:4</a></sup> <strong>beasts, cattle</strong>, coll. <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Aramaic <em>id.</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܥܺܝܪܳܐ</span>, Ethiopic ብዕራዊ etc., Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">בער</span> DHM<sup>ZMG 1876, 674; 1883, 329</sup>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَعِيرٌ</span> of <em>camel;</em> also <em>ass</em>, etc., cf. Lane <sup>227 a</sup>; connexion with above √ obscure<strong>)</strong>—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעִירֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:4\" href=\"/Exodus.22.4\">Ex 22:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעִירֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:4\" href=\"/Numbers.20.4\">Nu 20:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעִירְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:17\" href=\"/Genesis.45.17\">Gn 45:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעִירָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:8\" href=\"/Numbers.20.8\">Nu 20:8</a> + 2 times;—<em>beasts</em> of burden <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:17\" href=\"/Genesis.45.17\">Gn 45:17</a> (i.e. asses <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:3\" href=\"/Genesis.44.3\">44:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:13\" href=\"/Genesis.44.13\">13</a>); elsewhere general, <em>cattle</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:4\" href=\"/Exodus.22.4\">Ex 22:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:4\" href=\"/Numbers.20.4\">Nu 20:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:8\" href=\"/Numbers.20.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:11\" href=\"/Numbers.20.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:48\" href=\"/Psalms.78.48\">ψ 78:48</a>.","next":"BDB, בָּעַר²","prev":"BDB, תַּבְעֵרָה"}